<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Frank Rushton Neighborhood Association</title>

<style>
:root {
  --primary: #1f3c5b;
  --accent: #3c7db6;
  --light: #f4f6f8;
  --dark: #222;
  --max-width: 1100px;
}

* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
  font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: var(--dark);
  background: white;
}

/* Header */
header {
  position: fixed;
  width: 100%;
  top: 0;
  background: white;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  z-index: 1000;
}

.nav-container {
  max-width: var(--max-width);
  margin: auto;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 1rem;
}

.logo {
  font-size: 1.2rem;
  font-weight: bold;
  color: var(--primary);
}

nav ul {
  list-style: none;
  display: flex;
}

nav ul li {
  margin-left: 1.5rem;
}

nav a {
  text-decoration: none;
  color: var(--dark);
  font-weight: 500;
  transition: color 0.3s ease;
}

nav a:hover {
  color: var(--accent);
}

/* Hero */
.hero {
  height: 90vh;
  background: linear-gradient(rgba(31,60,91,0.7), rgba(31,60,91,0.7)),
              url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507089947368-19c1da9775ae?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80')
              no-repeat center center/cover;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  text-align: center;
  color: white;
  padding: 0 20px;
}

.hero-content {
  max-width: 700px;
}

.hero h1 {
  font-size: 2.5rem;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.hero p {
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
}

.btn {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
  background: var(--accent);
  color: white;
  text-decoration: none;
  border-radius: 4px;
  transition: background 0.3s ease;
}

.btn:hover {
  background: #2f6798;
}

/* Sections */
section {
  padding: 5rem 1rem;
}

.container {
  max-width: var(--max-width);
  margin: auto;
}

.section-title {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
  font-size: 1.8rem;
  color: var(--primary);
}

.light {
  background: var(--light);
}

/* Cards */
.cards {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
  gap: 1.5rem;
}

.card {
  background: white;
  padding: 1.5rem;
  border-radius: 6px;
  box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
}

.card h3 {
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  color: var(--primary);
}

/* Contact */
.contact-info {
  text-align: center;
  line-height: 1.8;
}

/* Footer */
footer {
  background: var(--primary);
  color: white;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 1.5rem 1rem;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
}

/* Mobile */
@media(max-width: 768px) {
  nav ul {
    flex-direction: column;
    background: white;
    position: absolute;
    top: 60px;
    right: 0;
    width: 200px;
    display: none;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
  }

  nav ul.show {
    display: block;
  }

  nav ul li {
    margin: 1rem;
  }

  .menu-toggle {
    display: block;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }
}

.menu-toggle {
  display: none;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <div class="nav-container">
    <div class="logo">Frank Rushton NA</div>
    <div class="menu-toggle" onclick="toggleMenu()">☰</div>
    <nav>
      <ul id="nav-links">
        <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
        <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
        <li><a href="#events">Events</a></li>
        <li><a href="#news">News</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <h1>Welcome to Frank Rushton Neighborhood Association</h1>
    <p>Building community, supporting neighbors, and strengthening our shared future together.</p>
    <a href="#about" class="btn">Learn More</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">About Us</h2>
    <p>
      The Frank Rushton Neighborhood Association exists to promote community engagement,
      neighborhood improvement, and collaboration among residents. We work to ensure our
      neighborhood remains safe, welcoming, and vibrant for everyone.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="light" id="events">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Upcoming Events</h2>
    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Monthly Meeting</h3>
        <p>Second Tuesday of each month at 6:30 PM.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Neighborhood Cleanup</h3>
        <p>Community-wide cleanup and beautification event this spring.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Block Party</h3>
        <p>Annual summer gathering with food, music, and family activities.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="news">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Neighborhood News</h2>
    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Community Updates</h3>
        <p>Stay informed about local developments and city announcements affecting our neighborhood.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Volunteer Opportunities</h3>
        <p>Interested in helping? Join a committee or volunteer for upcoming events.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="light" id="contact">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Contact Us</h2>
    <div class="contact-info">
      <p>Email: info@frankrushton.org</p>
      <p>Follow us on Facebook for updates.</p>
      <p>Meetings held locally within the neighborhood.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  © 2026 Frank Rushton Neighborhood Association | All Rights Reserved
</footer>

<script>
function toggleMenu() {
  document.getElementById("nav-links").classList.toggle("show");
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
